msgstr "Koprocesor CM4 nahrazen Open-AMP *(tooling)*"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.5.6.rst:204
msgid ""
"The deprecated CM4 coprocessor firmware mechanism on GIGA / Nicla Vision / "
"Portenta H7 was removed and replaced by Open-AMP/RPMsg. Dual-core code must "
"move to the Open-AMP model (a vuart example is provided)."
msgstr ""
"Zastaralý mechanismus firmwaru koprocesoru CM4 na GIGA / Nicla Vision / "
"Portenta H7 byl odstraněn a nahrazen Open-AMP/RPMsg. Dvoujádrový kód musí "
"přejít na model Open-AMP (je k dispozici příklad vuart)."

